{"id":"n54805-1-7","stage":4,"title":"먹구름 · 乌云","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54805-1-7-1","ko":"하늘에 먹구름이 잔뜩 꼈네.","zh":"天上乌云密布啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하늘에","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹구름이","meaning":"乌云","explanation":"먹구름：乌云；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"먹구름","audio":"/audio/fe2ed8aa706e9bbeb4ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54805","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹구름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔뜩","meaning":"满满地","explanation":"잔뜩：满满地","readings":[{"term":"잔뜩","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69821","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔뜩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼈네.","meaning":"弥漫，笼罩","explanation":"끼다：弥漫，笼罩；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73961","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"fe2ed8aa706e9bbe","term":"먹구름","zh":"乌云","audio":"/audio/fe2ed8aa706e9bbeb4ad.mp3","entryId":"54805","definition":"即将下雨或下雪时出现的黑云。","pronunciation":["먹꾸름"]},{"id":"f48d09fc20ac9971","term":"잔뜩","zh":"满满地","audio":"/audio/f48d09fc20ac9971096e.mp3","entryId":"69821","definition":"充满得达到极限为止。","pronunciation":["잔뜩"]},{"id":"62c9da6515c8237f","term":"끼다","zh":"弥漫，笼罩","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3","entryId":"73961","definition":"云、雾、烟等扩散而相互交织在一起。","pronunciation":["끼ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ba6a151447d75547cb4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54805-1-7-2","ko":"응. 아직 오후인데도 벌써 해가 진 것같이 어두워.","zh":"是啊，虽然还是下午，却已经黑得像太阳下山了一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오후인데도","meaning":"下午，午后","explanation":"오후：下午，午后；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"오후","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67457","senseId":"1","lemma":"오후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해가","meaning":"太阳","explanation":"해：太阳；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72468","senseId":"1","lemma":"해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진","meaning":"落","explanation":"지다：落；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62496","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것같이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어두워.","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"7575a29f7d674595","term":"오후","zh":"下午，午后","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3","entryId":"67457","definition":"从中午到太阳落山的期间。","pronunciation":["오ː후"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"b4ec4274b7799f1f","term":"해","zh":"太阳","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3","entryId":"72468","definition":"位于太阳系的中心，温度极高，自行发光的恒星。","pronunciation":["해"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"落","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"62496","definition":"太阳或月亮西下。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]}],"audio":"/audio/81af62b16fdaaa2b487c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54805","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3184,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，虽然还是下午，却已经黑得像太阳下山了一样。","那边在游乐场玩耍的那个孩子是我儿子。","天上乌云密布啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，虽然还是下午，却已经黑得像太阳下山了一样。","天上乌云密布啊。","那边在游乐场玩耍的那个孩子是我儿子。"],"answer":0}]}
